{
 "brief": "The Palestinian Ministry of Prisoners held the Israeli occupation responsible for the death of prisoner Diab and called for an international investigation into the circumstances, Shehab Wire reported. The ministry did not specify additional details about how Diab died or when he was detained.\n\nThe demand for an international probe reflected escalating Palestinian complaints about conditions in Israeli detention facilities. Palestinian officials have repeatedly accused Israeli authorities of mistreatment and inadequate medical care of detainees. The case of Diab added to a growing list of prisoner deaths that Palestinian officials have attributed to negligence or abuse by Israeli forces.",
